{"id":"09791de618b277ba","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-induction-schema.md","title":"按语言参数化的归纳模式","display":"df-induction-schema — 按语言参数化的归纳模式","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-induction-schema","aliases":["91-df-induction-schema","91-df-induction-axiom","91-df-mathematical-induction"],"display":"df-induction-schema — 按语言参数化的归纳模式","depends_on":["[[91-df-ground-language]]","[[91-df-language-with-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-induction-schema"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-induction-schema</span><span>91-df-induction-axiom</span><span>91-df-mathematical-induction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-induction-schema — 按语言参数化的归纳模式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2ad7561edabb2148\" href=\"?note=2ad7561edabb2148\" title=\"91-df-ground-language\">91-df-ground-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97fe560478d37064\" href=\"?note=97fe560478d37064\" title=\"91-df-language-with-truth\">91-df-language-with-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-induction-schema-—-按语言参数化的归纳模式-$\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal-L}$\">df-induction-schema — 按语言参数化的归纳模式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> (含算术符号的语言)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 的公式集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0\\subseteq\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_0\\subseteq\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> (基础语言及其真理扩张)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}induction\\text{-}schema}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L}\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\forall\\bar y\\,\n\\left[\n\\left(\n\\varphi(0,\\bar y)\n\\land\n\\forall x\\,\n\\bigl(\\varphi(x,\\bar y)\\to\\varphi(x+1,\\bar y)\\bigr)\n\\right)\n\\to\n\\forall x\\,\\varphi(x,\\bar y)\n\\right]\n:\n\\varphi(x,\\bar y)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}\n\\land\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\cup\\bar y\n\\right\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}induction\\text{-}schema}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L}\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\forall\\bar y\\,\n\\left[\n\\left(\n\\varphi(0,\\bar y)\n\\land\n\\forall x\\,\n\\bigl(\\varphi(x,\\bar y)\\to\\varphi(x+1,\\bar y)\\bigr)\n\\right)\n\\to\n\\forall x\\,\\varphi(x,\\bar y)\n\\right]\n:\n\\varphi(x,\\bar y)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}\n\\land\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\cup\\bar y\n\\right\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}induction\\text{-}schema}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ind}_0\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_0},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Ind}_T\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Ind}_0\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ind}_T.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}induction\\text{-}schema}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ind}_0\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_0},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Ind}_T\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Ind}_0\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ind}_T.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_0\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_0\\)</span> 只允许不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的归纳公式；\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_T\\)</span> 还允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 出现在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 中。TB、UTB 与\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\)</span> 的标准保守版本只有基础语言归纳；本目录定义的\nTB<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"^+\">\\(^+\\)</span>、UTB<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"^+\">\\(^+\\)</span>、CT、KF 以及标准 FS 使用扩展语言归纳。\n若文献改用正公式归纳或有界真理归纳，必须另行标注，不能仍称完全\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_T\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>普通扩展语言归纳也不同于把\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\ulcorner\\varphi(0)\\urcorner)\">\\(T(\\ulcorner\\varphi(0)\\urcorner)\\)</span> 等真理断言组成的“内部归纳原则”。\n两者可以在有足够组合公理时相关，但不是同一个模式。</p>\n<p>扩展语言归纳常使真理理论能够对证明编码进行归纳，从而建立声性或\n一致性结果；具体强度仍取决于真理公理。正确的例子是：标准全归纳 KF\n能证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>，而保守的 TB 不能。不能从\n“只有基础归纳”这一句法事实单独推出关于任意理论的一致性结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-induction-schema-—-按语言参数化的归纳模式-$\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal-L}$","text":"df-induction-schema — 按语言参数化的归纳模式 $\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-ground-language","status":"resolved","id":"2ad7561edabb2148","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-ground-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-language-with-truth","status":"resolved","id":"97fe560478d37064","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-language-with-truth]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_0\\subseteq\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}induction\\text{-}schema}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L}\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\forall\\bar y\\,\n\\left[\n\\left(\n\\varphi(0,\\bar y)\n\\land\n\\forall x\\,\n\\bigl(\\varphi(x,\\bar y)\\to\\varphi(x+1,\\bar y)\\bigr)\n\\right)\n\\to\n\\forall x\\,\\varphi(x,\\bar y)\n\\right]\n:\n\\varphi(x,\\bar y)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}\n\\land\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\cup\\bar y\n\\right\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}induction\\text{-}schema}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ind}_0\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_0},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Ind}_T\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Ind}_0\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ind}_T.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}_0","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}_T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}","display":false},{"tex":"^+","display":false},{"tex":"^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}_T","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\ulcorner\\varphi(0)\\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false}],"bytes":2205,"backlinks":[{"id":"d039c2f88345c0e7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4e1e503ea918b41a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal{L}_T}$ (扩展语言的完全归纳模式, see [[91-df-induction-schema]])"},{"id":"a0a2284f96eaea1d","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}$ (扩展语言的归纳模式, see [[91-df-induction-schema]])"},{"id":"5e2485d60abdf08e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal{L}_T}$ (扩展语言的归纳模式, see [[91-df-induction-schema]])"}